TO DO BEFORE DISTRIBUTING THIS PROJECT
--------------------------------------

The paragraphs above are deliberately generic. Replace them with the terms
of the actual commercial license, or replace this file with the executed
agreement, before you publish or distribute this project. At minimum the
final text must state:

  1. who grants the license (legal entity and contact),
